# A SEVEN-NODE SPLINE, FULLY CONSTRAINED -- DOF 0.
#
# Every one of its seven points is nameable now (M17.30): the two ends by name,
# the five between them by index. Drawn by eye and pulled onto exact numbers.

sketch Blade7

tool spline
click 7 -13
click 33 31
click 61 -7
click 92 27
click 119 -5
click 147 23
click 173 -11
finish

# The two ends, pinned outright.
constrain fix Spline1.start
dimension hdistance Spline1.start Spline1.end 180 as Span
dimension vdistance Spline1.start Spline1.end 0 as EndRise

# ...and the five interior points, each placed from the start point.
dimension hdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p1 30 as X1
dimension vdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p1 45 as Y1
dimension hdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p2 60 as X2
dimension vdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p2 -8 as Y2
dimension hdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p3 90 as X3
dimension vdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p3 40 as Y3
dimension hdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p4 120 as X4
dimension vdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p4 -6 as Y4
dimension hdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p5 150 as X5
dimension vdistance Spline1.start Spline1.p5 35 as Y5

solve
